      "updated": 1786004555224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚙️ Core Cross-Cutting Services\n\n• Resilient Model Gateway\n  - Primary: Gemini 3.5 Flash / 2.5 Pro\n  - Fallback: OpenAI GPT-4o Mini\n\n• Image Generation Gateway\n  - Gemini Flash Image / Imagen 3\n\n• Real-Time Observability\n  - Cost & Latency Tracking (CostTracker)\n  - Token usage per node\n  - SSE streaming to Web UI\n\n• Docker & AWS CI/CD Infrastructure\n  - GitHub Actions (ci.yml & cd.yml)\n  - Self-hosted AWS EC2 Runner\n  - Twelve-Factor Secret Management",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": "rect_side",
      "originalText": "⚙️ Core Cross-Cutting Services\n\n• Resilient Model Gateway\n  - Primary: Gemini 3.5 Flash / 2.5 Pro\n  - Fallback: OpenAI GPT-4o Mini\n\n• Image Generation Gateway\n  - Gemini Flash Image / Imagen 3\n\n• Real-Time Observability\n  - Cost & Latency Tracking (CostTracker)\n  - Token usage per node\n  - SSE streaming to Web UI\n\n• Docker & AWS CI/CD Infrastructure\n  - GitHub Actions (ci.yml & cd.yml)\n  - Self-hosted AWS EC2 Runner\n  - Twelve-Factor Secret Management",
